      "content": "that's kind of how it feels yeah. like disappearing. \n\nbut the thing is i don't know who i am without people around me. like — i have these memories of being this person. funny at dinner tables, the one who remembered everyone's birthdays, the one who organized things. and that person doesn't exist anymore because there's no one to be her for.\n\nsometimes i think the version of me that existed in that group is just... dead. and i don't know if this version is worth keeping.",
